This directory is a modified copy of token-saviour, originally from
https://github.com/vagkaratzas/token-saviour (MIT, © 2026 Evangelos Karatzas).

Modifications by the ai-efficiency-kit maintainers (2026-11-03): removed all
network-install one-liners (`curl … | sh/bash`, `irm … | iex`) and tool
hook/MCP auto-wiring references from references/tool_links.md; install
instructions now use package managers only. SKILL.md routing guidance and
references/benchmark_results.md data are unchanged. See ../../VETTING.md.
